{"id":"la_grima","lemma":"lágrima","pos":"noun","rank":1778,"glosses":["tear, teardrop"],"ipa":"/ˈlaɡɾima/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"lágrimas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-l%C3%A1grima.wav","examples":[{"text":"No pude controlar mis lágrimas.","en":"I couldn't control my tears.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639264","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to control, to rein in"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Yo vi lágrimas en sus ojos.","en":"I saw tears in her eyes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594326","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},{"g":"eye","l":"ojo"}]},{"text":"Son lágrimas de alegría.","en":"They're tears of joy.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"joy, happiness"}]},{"text":"No derramó ni una lágrima.","en":"He didn't shed a tear.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to spill, to leak","l":"derramar"},{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ella se enjugó las lágrimas.","en":"She wiped away her tears.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/50797","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}